### SA-001 (Medium): The size check is correct within `ValidateBody` but occurs AFTER full block deserialization, transaction decoding, and Merkle trie root computation have already consumed CPU and memory. An attacker can force these resource-intensive operations with payloads that will ultimately be rejected.

